//  Five checks, in the documented order, each with its own label and its own
//  `return`. The structure IS the lesson.
//
//  **One assertion per rule.** The tempting version is one big condition:
//
//      if (i("") != "" || i("Ada") != "A" || i("ada lovelace") != "AL") …
//
